#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:5 c4c59122c4284fa29785f9578487aafe
msgid "Follow Mode"
msgstr "Follow 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:10 a7bf3ea6d87e4ae881681528455a7638
msgid ""
"When switched into Follow, the vehicle will attempt to follow another "
"vehicle (or anything publishing its position) at a specified offset.  The "
"lead vehicle's position must be published to the vehicle in Follow mode "
"using a telemetry system as shown below. QGroundControl's application (QGC) "
"for Android phones and computers has this feature in beta testing also, so "
"instead of following a vehicle, it will follow the ground control station, "
"similar to FOLLOW ME mode in Copter."
msgstr ""
"切换到 Follow 模式后，车辆将尝试以指定偏移量跟随另一辆车辆（或任何发布其位置的对象）。领头车辆的位置必须通过如下所示的数传系统发布给处于 "
"Follow 模式的车辆。Android 手机和电脑版 "
"QGroundControl（QGC）应用程序也有此功能的测试版，因此不是跟随车辆，而是跟随地面控制站，类似于 Copter 中的 FOLLOW ME "
"模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:12 94f573851e3841d38fd75feb027533c1
msgid ""
"In its simplest form, each vehicle has a telemetry radio with the same "
"NETID, on one of their telemetry ports."
msgstr "最简单的形式是：每辆车在其中一个数传端口上安装具有相同 NETID 的数传无线电。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:17 3f4b0c1e72dc482daec39300e2a2b1df
msgid ""
"Vehicle A merely enters FOLLOW mode and it will attempt to follow Vehicle B,"
" and vice-versa."
msgstr "车辆 A 只需进入 Follow 模式，即可尝试跟随车辆 B，反之亦然。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:19 fcf271e553f444cbab74d728ebdd42b9
msgid ""
"If Vehicle A or B requires Ground Station Control, an additional Telemetry "
"radio on a different NETID (YY) can be installed on another telemetry port "
"on the vehicle controller, paired with the GCS's radio on that same NETID."
msgstr ""
"如果车辆 A 或 B 需要地面站控制，可以在车辆控制器的另一个数传端口上安装使用不同 NETID（YY）的额外数传无线电，与地面站上相同 NETID "
"的无线电配对。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:24 90530a1c32c8402ea9844e202cffd0b9
msgid ""
"If using QGroundControl ensure the Application setting under the General tab"
" ``Stream GCS Position`` is set to \"When in Follow Me Flight Mode\" or "
"\"Always\".  Next connect to the vehicle and switch to FOLLOW Mode and it "
"will then follow the computer/phone running QGC."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 QGroundControl，请确保常规选项卡下的应用程序设置中 ``Stream GCS Position`` 设置为「在 Follow "
"Me 飞行模式时」或「始终」。然后连接到车辆并切换到 Follow 模式，它将跟随运行 QGC 的电脑/手机。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:29 e41c3cfc07014a368ce1952535905308
msgid ""
"The following parameters can be used to tune Follow mode's performance:"
msgstr "以下参数可用于调整 Follow 模式的性能："

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:31 e3e96b4e9b5c454b95e18aac011dc9ed
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_ENABLE <FOLL_ENABLE>`: set to 1 to enable follow mode and refresh"
" parameters."
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_ENABLE <FOLL_ENABLE>`：设置为 1 以启用 Follow 模式并刷新参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:32 a06e2de76e3c4aa2b4af636bde1b5862
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_SYSID <FOLL_SYSID>`: MAVLink system id of lead vehicle (\"0\" "
"means follow the first vehicle \"seen\")."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_SYSID <FOLL_SYSID>`：领头车辆的 MAVLink 系统 ID（「0」表示跟随第一个「发现」的车辆）。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:33 d15dc46084a84870bb6180aa76d244bf
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_DIST_MAX <FOLL_DIST_MAX>`: if lead vehicle is more than this many"
" meters away, give up on following and hold position (loiter if boat, stop "
"if ground vehicle)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_DIST_MAX <FOLL_DIST_MAX>`：如果领头车辆距离超过此值（米），则放弃跟随并保持位置（若为船则 "
"Loiter，若为地面车辆则停止）。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:34 25ec12ec5acb44279ed215e925fb13a8
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X <FOLL_OFS_X>`, :ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y <FOLL_OFS_Y>`, "
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z <FOLL_OFS_Z>` (not used in Rover) : 3D offset (in meters) "
"from the lead vehicle. If they are zero, then the current vehicle's offset "
"from the follow target at time of mode entry is used every time. These "
"offsets can be altered via Mavlink and will take effect immediately. "
"However, if they were originally zero and changed during FOLLOW MODE rather "
"than during another mode, they will be reset to zero for the next entry into"
" FOLLOW mode, until a reboot occurs and then the changed offsets will be "
"restored."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X <FOLL_OFS_X>`、:ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y "
"<FOLL_OFS_Y>`、:ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z <FOLL_OFS_Z>` （Rover "
"中不使用）：相对领头车辆的三维偏移量（米）。如果为零，则每次使用进入模式时当前车辆与跟随目标的偏移量。这些偏移量可通过 MAVLink "
"更改，并立即生效。但是，如果它们原来为零并在 Follow 模式中（而非其他模式中）被更改，则下次进入 Follow "
"模式时将重置为零，直到重启后更改的偏移量才会恢复。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:35 b23929141bb34e07a459f5f4960bbf5e
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_TYPE <FOLL_OFS_TYPE>`: set to 0 if offsets are North-East "
"(NED), 1 if offsets are relative to lead vehicle's heading, see diagrams "
"below."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_TYPE <FOLL_OFS_TYPE>`：若偏移量为北东坐标系（NED）则设为 0，若偏移量相对于领头车辆航向则设为 "
"1，详见下图。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:36 46e9ab768b354ee0babd37f8ed421ae9
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_POS_P <FOLL_POS_P>`: gain which controls how aggressively this "
"vehicle moves towards lead vehicle (limited by :ref:`WPNAV_SPEED "
"<WPNAV_SPEED>`)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_POS_P <FOLL_POS_P>`：控制此飞行器向目标飞行器移动积极程度的增益（受 :ref:`WPNAV_SPEED "
"<WPNAV_SPEED>` 限制）"
